  "provenance": "Stations read from the nationwide AdV SAPOS overview map 'GNSS-Referenzstationen' (Stand August 2025, zentrale-stelle-sapos.de; the LGL state map external_sapos_bw.refmap.png was used to confirm the roster). Baden-Wuerttemberg's 23 own red SAPOS dots are kept (neighbouring networks excluded). Each dot's pixel centre was converted to coordinates with a bilinear georeference (map tilt, lon/lat scale, and meridian convergence) calibrated on register-grade neighbouring SAPOS stations (NW/BB/HE/MV) plus surveyed EPN marks; leave-one-out accuracy about 1.5 km, so coordinates are given to 2 decimals. Bremgarten keeps its surveyed EPN position (BRMG00DEU). The network publishes only the VRS service, so the map is the roster and position source. Regenerated by scripts/regen_external_sapos_map.py.",
